Underlying tourism, payment, and demographic data are sourced from official
public institutions (BPS, Bank Indonesia, Kementerian Pariwisata RI, Kemendagri
Ditjen Dukcapil, UNESCO) and PT Bank Central Asia Tbk's public disclosures.
Data usage should comply with each source's own terms; see the About page and
MASTER_TOURISM_DATABASE_FINAL.xlsx (09_Reference_Master sheet) for full
attribution.
